{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Brave Never Alone is a fully auto-idle game. A warrior is abandoned in the game world, and slashes slimes in this endless world alone. There is no end to the cycle of defeating and being defeated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Finding Slimes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finding and defeating Slimes is the only goal of the warrior.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790750/extras/a591ac3dbf92b5f6991ae167cb2c3e2c.poster.avif?t=1753160778\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790750/extras/a591ac3dbf92b5f6991ae167cb2c3e2c.webm?t=1753160778\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790750/extras/a591ac3dbf92b5f6991ae167cb2c3e2c.mp4?t=1753160778\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Attribute increase or decrease</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeating a slime can increase the warrior's attributes randomly and make him stronger, but being defeated will randomly reduce his attributes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790750/extras/d70a1c059555ac119e0994328f2ea21b.poster.avif?t=1753160778\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790750/extras/d70a1c059555ac119e0994328f2ea21b.webm?t=1753160778\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790750/extras/d70a1c059555ac119e0994328f2ea21b.mp4?t=1753160778\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Freely adjust the window size</h2